¬import il from "../../../../../_shared/variables/imageLinks"


2. Replace the contents of the `.cspell.json` file with: *- yellow ring* 


```json
{
    "language": "en-GB",
    "files": [
        "tsmaps/**/*.tsstp",
        "tsmaps/**/*.md"
    ],
    "ignoreRegExpList": [
        "{{::[A-Za-z0-9_\\.]+}}",
        "¬import\\s+.*",
        "`[^`]+`"
    ],
    "words": [
        "tsstp",
        "tsvar",
        "Vscode"
    ]
}
```

{{::il.Vscode_InstallCodeSpellChecker_6_img}}


3. Save the `.cspell.json` file.

4. Then copy the `.cspell.json` file to the root directory of every repo that uses **Docs Assembler**.

> **Note:** When you create a new **Docs Assembler** repo be sure to copy the `.cspell.json` file into it.

